  "body": "Red on the Windows box (xiaomi-gpu, Windows 11, Go 1.26.8) in a full `go test -timeout 45m ./...` through win-run at main 373cab2b0 (2026-11-05). Windows CI only compiles the tests, so nothing else shows it (#1827). Unrelated to 373cab2b0, which changes only the Cursor mover's min string.\n\nPackage: internal/agent\n\n```\n--- FAIL: TestHowInstalledWindowsShim (0.02s)\n    cliupdate_test.go:294: windows shim: &{via:npm pkg:@anthropic-ai/claude-code cask:false brew: cmd:[C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestHowInstalledWindowsShim1362945323\\001\\npm\\npm.cmd install -g --prefix C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestHowInstalledWindowsShim1362945323\\001\\npm --allow-scripts=@anthropic-ai/claude-code @anthropic-ai/claude-code@latest] path:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestHowInstalledWindowsShim1362945323\\001\\npm admin:false prefix:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestHowInstalledWindowsShim1362945323\\001\\npm latest:<nil> reshim:[]}\n2026/11/05 14:28:31 codex: 1 thread(s) started on custom moved to OpenAI, where Codex resumes them beside its sign-in\n```\n\nNot investigated: the cause. Not run: macOS or Linux (passes on CI there).\n",
