   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5344-windows-claude-script-expectation), commit [a3b849417](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/a3b84941734639435c316efd4340a30a4cc24eeb), based on ed0ab567.\n\nThe Windows shim assertion predates the package-scoped `--allow-scripts=@anthropic-ai/claude-code` argument. Production already emits that permission for Claude's install script; the test now expects it while retaining the exact npm path, prefix and package checks.\n\nFocused agent tests pass with race, the Windows amd64 test binary cross-compiles, agent vet and the full offline nogui build pass. Native Windows execution was not available, so this is checked against your exact failure and the current command builder, not a claimed Windows runtime pass. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
